  "body": "Yes of course.\n\nI think it doesn't work because when I click on “Save current image” while holding down the Ctrl key, it produces the same result as when I click without holding down Ctrl. An export window opens.\n\nPerhaps the Ctrl-click shortcut isn't working, because most shortcuts that use Alt for example (Option on Mac) don't work either (for example, Alt+S doesn't take a snapshot), but I don't have the Fast Export tab in Preferences either, which is strange.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a91ad397-5383-4c4c-89b8-d7f58f5d4de6",
